{{Morphnotes
| name = Devoured Ability
| desc = Corresponds to {{H|Doom}}'s current acquired abilities.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Devoured Ability
| desc = Can independently acquire the last cast Devoured ability.
}}
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Devoured Ability
| desc = [[Grimstroke#Soulbind|Soulbind]] considers the Devoured Abilities as hero abilities.
}}

 * Appears in the {{Spellslot|4|6}} upon {{A|Doom|Devour}} cast.

* Does not acquire the following abilities:
** [[Attack Class]]-based abilities.
** Abilities that are granted by other heroes.
** Abilities from {{M|summons}}.

* {{cf|expr}}
** The acquired abilities have two main ability formulas based on the original {{M|cast point}} ({{Code|X}}) of the acquired ability:
*** {{Code|[[Cast Point|CastPoint]] {{=}} X}}
*** {{Code|[[Cast Backswing|CastBackswing]] {{=}} {{#var:Devoured Ability 1 value1}} - X, 0 when X ≥ {{#var:Devoured Ability 1 value1}}}}

