{{Illusionnotes
| name = Infernal Blade
| desc = Neither functional nor is [[toggled]] {{Symbol|Toggle|On}}.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Infernal Blade
| desc = Cannot acquire active {{M|attack modifiers}}.
| structure = hidden
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Infernal Blade
| desc = Utilizes the caster's current {{M|attack range}} while {{M|Autocast}} is active, manual cast utilizes the ability's current {{M|cast range}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Infernal Blade is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Lucifer's current {{M|attack range}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component is not applied by [[instant attack]] sources.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Bash}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[bash]]ed}}
*#* Stack independently with other bash sources.
*#* However, the debuff with greater duration takes precedence.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|doom_bringer_infernal_blade_burn}}
*#* Deals {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in 1-second intervals, starting 1 second upon debuff application, over {{#var:Infernal Blade value3}} instances.
*#** Reapplying the debuff applies a new and independent instance.
*#** Both leveling up the ability and the {{ValueColor||max health as damage increasing|15tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2l}} do not update the damage of the current instances.
*# Lucifer's attack damage.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Doom|Lvl ? Pain}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Infernal Blade icon0}}
| desc = Doom swings his burning sword, igniting the enemy. Stuns for 0.66 seconds and applies a 4 second burn that deals a base damage plus a percentage of the target's Max HP as damage per second.
}}
* Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Infernal Blade value3}}|v1={{#var:Infernal Blade value1}}}} + {{calc|v1*{{#var:Infernal Blade value3}}|v1={{#var:Infernal Blade value2}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Infernal Blade value3}}|v1={{#var:Infernal Blade value2 tal}}|%}}|15tal}}) max health as damage ([[before reductions]]) for the entire duration.

