fields.value:
{{Splblocknotes
| name = Doom
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Self-cast does not proc [[Spell Block]] sources.
}} 
{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Doom
| desc = May indirectly cast on {{M|ancient creeps}} upon [[Spell Reflection]] proc.
}} 
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Doom
| desc = May indirectly cast on {{M|ancient creeps}} as secondary target.
}}

 * Has the following targeting functionalities:
** Cannot be cast on {{M|ancient creeps}}.
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** When unit-targeted, applies the {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|doom_bringer_doom_enemy_aura}} to the affected enemy unit.
*** {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} or {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
**** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Lucifier.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** {{Symbol|bonus agh}} The {{M|aura}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**# The offensive {{M|basic dispel}} upon cast.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|doom_bringer_doom_enemy}}
**#* {{M|Silence}}
**#** Does not prevent {{M|channeling}} {{A|Outpost|Watch Tower}}.
**#* {{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{M|Mute}}
**#** {{cf|talnotes}} Learning the [[talent]] does not update the the current instance.
**#* {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{M|Break}}
**#** {{cf|aghnotes}} Both acquiring and losing the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} do not update the current instance.
**#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes the duration and update the ability values.
**#** Leveling up Doom does not update the current instance.
**#* Applies a [[heal negation]] that prevents the following sources from increasing {{M|current health}}:
**#** Flat current health sources.
**#** Percentage-based current health sources.
**#** {{M|Strength}} sources.
**#** {{A|Ancient Granite Golem|Granite Aura}}
**# Deals {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}} in 1-second intervals, starting immediately upon debuff application, over {{calc|v1+1|v1={{#var:Doom value3}}}} instances.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|doom_bringer_doom_aura_self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Aura}}
** Enables casting on allied units, applying all ability effects as an [[aura]] centered around the affected unit.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** Applies all ability effects centered around the affected allied unit, following the same intervals.
*** The {{M|basic dispel}} is not applied on affected enemy units upon entering or exiting the aura radius.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Self-casting the ability does not disable Lucifer.
*** Does not nullify the aura even when being affected by the following sources:
**** {{M|Hidden}} sources.
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} sources.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Affects the following units:
**** {{M|Ancient creeps}}.
**** {{M|Couriers}}
*** Does not affect the following enemy units:
**** {{M|Hidden}} units, in any way.
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
***** Fully affects invulnerable units, if the debuff is applied the unit becomes invulnerable.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Doom icon0}}
| desc = Inflicts a curse that dispels an enemy and prevents them from casting spells or healing in any way, while taking damage over time.
}}
* The health freeze component does not prevent the following sources from increasing {{M|current health}}:
** [[Setting health]] sources.
** Max health increasing sources.
** The following ability sources:
*** {{A|Clinkz|Death Pact}}
*** {{A|Timbersaw|Whirling Death}}
*** {{A|Undying|Decay}}

* Deals {{calc|v1*(v2+1)|v1={{#var:Doom value2}}|v2={{#var:Doom value3}}}} {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) for the entire duration.

